{
  "content": "<h1 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InternalPdfGenerator\">Internal PDF generator</h1>\n<p translate=\"true\">The internal PDF generator in Manager.io is now considered an obsolete feature. However, it remains available within the program for backward compatibility.</p>\n<p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Print\">We strongly recommend using the standard <strong>Print</strong> button and then selecting <strong>Print to PDF</strong> instead.</p>\n<p translate=\"true\"><div><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-900 p-8 dark:text-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 text-sm\"><span class=\"bg-white font-bold border border-neutral-300 text-neutral-700 rounded py-2 px-4\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Print\">Print</span></span></div></div></div></p>\n<h2 translate=\"true\">Activating the Internal PDF Generator</h2>\n<p translate=\"true\">To activate the internal PDF generator:</p>\n<ol>\n<li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Settings ObsoleteFeatures\">Navigate to <strong>Settings</strong>, then click <strong>Obsolete Features</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p translate=\"true\"><div><div class=\"flex pointer-events-none space-x-6 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex space-x-2 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><span class=\"rtl:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-right text-2xl text-neutral-300\"></i></span><span class=\"ltr:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-left text-2xl text-neutral-300\"></i></span><div class=\"border rounded inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"basis-72 flex items-center space-x-2 rtl:space-x-reverse p-4\"><i class=\"text-3xl text-neutral-400 dark:text-slate-400 fas fa-fw fa-scroll-old\"></i><span class=\"text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ObsoleteFeatures\">Obsolete Features</span></span></div></div></div></div></p>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InternalPdfGenerator\">Click on <strong>Internal PDF generator</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"View\">After activation, a <strong>PDF</strong> button will become available in the <strong>View</strong> screens for transactions and reports.</p>\n",
  "key": "internal-pdf-generator-form"
}
